				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; This is the original site of the JAE Data Archive, which was hosted by a server belonging to the Economics Department of Queen&#039;s University from its origin in 1994 until late 2022.
 In 2022, the JAE Data Archive moved to its new home at ZBW&#039;s site : https://www.re3data.org/repository/r3d100012190 &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt;
The JAE Data Archive, which is hosted by a server belonging to the Economics Department of Queen&#039;s University, contains data for all papers accepted after January, 1994, unless the data are confidential. There are also data for a few papers accepted earlier. Volume 10, No. 1 (1995) is the first issue in which all papers were accepted subject to the proviso that data be provided.
For some papers, especially more recent ones, the Data Archive also contains programs and supplementary material, such as technical appendices and additional graphs.</r3d:description>
